266
00:18:43,861 --> 00:18:47,461
Turns out she is an invisible girl, meaning we can eat her after all.

267
00:18:48,241 --> 00:18:50,821
Guess he'll be judged this time, growl, growl.

268
00:18:53,741 --> 00:18:55,701
Let the Yuri trial begin.

269
00:18:57,001 --> 00:18:58,321
I wish to eat her.

270
00:18:58,661 --> 00:19:02,241
That way I can save Kureha from the invisible storm, growl, growl.

271
00:19:02,241 --> 00:19:04,341
Not this again.

272
00:19:04,661 --> 00:19:07,841
Excuse me, but doesn't everyone want to protect the girl they love?

273
00:19:07,981 --> 00:19:08,741
Sparkle, sparkle.

274
00:19:09,161 --> 00:19:09,401
Meh.

275
00:19:09,681 --> 00:19:11,021
I wouldn't be too certain.

276
00:19:11,541 --> 00:19:11,841
Huh?

277
00:19:12,521 --> 00:19:13,281
Defendant bears.

278
00:19:13,481 --> 00:19:17,381
So far you've eaten several humans affiliated with this invisible storm.

279
00:19:17,621 --> 00:19:19,921
All in the name of saving Kureha Tsubaki.

280
00:19:19,921 --> 00:19:21,341
Is that correct?

281
00:19:22,281 --> 00:19:22,741
Yes.

282
00:19:23,301 --> 00:19:24,541
