284
00:19:28,881 --> 00:19:30,341
What is it that you want?

285
00:19:30,921 --> 00:19:32,501
And don't say to save Kureha.

286
00:19:32,721 --> 00:19:33,801
That's just an excuse.

287
00:19:34,301 --> 00:19:39,941
In fact, isn't it true all you really want is to make sure you are Kureha Tsubaki's one and only friend?

288
00:19:40,501 --> 00:19:40,981
Objection!

289
00:19:41,821 --> 00:19:42,261
Speculation!

290
00:19:42,421 --> 00:19:44,741
