300
00:20:06,621 --> 00:20:10,301
I want to be friends with her again, and I want to have Kureha's love again.

301
00:20:10,561 --> 00:20:12,241
That's the only reason I came here.

302
00:20:12,701 --> 00:20:15,721
That's the reason I crossed the wall and dragged Lulu into it with me.

303
00:20:15,781 --> 00:20:18,401
But Ginko, Lulu wanted to cross the wall with you.

304
00:20:18,441 --> 00:20:20,801
It doesn't matter though, I won't back down on love.

305
00:20:20,921 --> 00:20:22,961
